         "Residents in some blocks reported that top-floor flats felt slightly cooler since panels were fitted, as the panels shade the roof. Researchers are measuring whether the effect is large enough to matter.",
         "Panels are cleaned 4 times a year, and their output is monitored remotely. Town councils in Punggol and Tengah are now testing solar panels on the walls of multi-storey car parks, where roof space has run out.",
