         "Banks have added cooling-off periods for large transfers and allow customers to freeze their accounts instantly if they suspect a scam.",
         "Phone companies block millions of scam calls a month. Volunteers said technology helped but could not replace a moment's doubt: the most effective advice, they said, was to hang up and call back on a number you already know.",
